<%#
  Copy-paste prompt for setting up GHL auto-outreach workflow.
  Optional: promptId (default ghlAutoOutreachPrompt), compact (shorter header)
%>
<% const _promptId = typeof promptId !== 'undefined' && promptId ? String(promptId) : 'ghlAutoOutreachPrompt'; %>
<% const _copyBtnId = _promptId + 'CopyBtn'; %>
<% const _copyStatusId = _promptId + 'CopyStatus'; %>
<% const _compact = typeof compact !== 'undefined' && compact; %>
<% const _promptText = [
  'Set up a Go High Level automation workflow for cold outreach when AdHello / Agency OS enrolls a lead.',
  '',
  'Goal: GHL should act as a personalized sales agent for YOUR business — not a generic blast. If you run multiple businesses (e.g. flooring company, reviews app, digital ads consulting), each enrolled lead carries which profile is reaching out.',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'TRIGGER',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  '• Workflow type: Contact tag added',
  '• Tag name (exact): auto-outreach',
  '• Run once per contact when tag is first added',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'WAIT (important)',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  '• Wait 2 minutes after trigger',
  '  (AdHello needs time to sync contact + custom fields, including sender profile)',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'BUSINESS PROFILES — configure in Agency OS first',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'In Agency OS, each "business profile" is an Offer in Workspace → Scripts / Offers (custom catalog). For each offer set:',
  '• Label — display name (e.g. Premier Flooring Co, ReviewBoost App, AdHello Consulting)',
  '• Value proposition script — synced as AdHello Sender Pitch',
  '• Optional metadata on the offer (via catalog): senderBusinessName, vertical, auditLink',
  '',
  'Map profiles to outreach:',
  '• Per folder: Prospecting → Folders → Auto outreach → "Sender business profile" dropdown',
  '• Auto-pool: Workspace → GHL setup → default sender profile',
  '• On enroll, AdHello stamps the profile and syncs it to GHL before your workflow sends',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'MERGE FIELDS — prospect (the lead you are contacting)',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  '• Business: {{contact.company_name}}',
  '• First name: {{contact.first_name}}',
  '• City: {{contact.city}}',
  '• State: {{contact.state}}',
  '• Website: {{contact.website}}',
  '• Phone: {{contact.phone}}',
  '',
  'Prospect signals (auto-synced custom fields):',
  '• AdHello Google Rating',
  '• AdHello Google Reviews',
  '• AdHello Phone Line Type (Mobile, Landline, VoIP, Unknown)',
  '• AdHello SMS OK (Yes = safe to text; No = landline)',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'MERGE FIELDS — sender profile (YOUR business reaching out)',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'AdHello syncs these on every GHL push when a sender profile is set. Pick from GHL Insert Variable:',
  '',
  '• AdHello Sender Business — your company name (e.g. Premier Flooring Co)',
  '• AdHello Sender Vertical — industry (e.g. Flooring, SaaS / Reviews, Digital Marketing)',
  '• AdHello Sender Offer — profile label from Agency OS offer catalog',
  '• AdHello Sender Pitch — short value prop from that offer\'s script',
  '• AdHello Audit Link — optional per-profile audit / demo URL from Agency OS',
  '',
  'If AdHello Audit Link is empty, use your GHL audit widget URL in templates: [GHL AUDIT LINK]',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'PERSONALIZATION STRATEGY — one workflow, many businesses',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'Recommended: ONE workflow using merge fields (not separate workflows per business).',
  '',
  'Email subject pattern:',
  'Quick idea for {{contact.company_name}} — {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}',
  '',
  'Use {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Pitch}} in the body when you want the offer-specific hook.',
  'Use {{custom_field.AdHello Audit Link}} when set; otherwise [GHL AUDIT LINK].',
  '',
  'Optional IF branches (when you need very different tone per vertical):',
  '• IF AdHello Sender Vertical contains "Flooring" → flooring template block',
  '• IF AdHello Sender Vertical contains "Review" → SaaS / reviews app block',
  '• IF AdHello Sender Vertical contains "Marketing" OR Offer contains "AdHello" → consulting block',
  '• ELSE → generic template using Sender Pitch merge field',
  '',
  'Alternative: separate GHL workflows per profile, each triggered by tag auto-outreach AND contact tag sender:flooring (add manually in GHL) — merge-field approach is simpler.',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'STEP 1 — DAY 0 EMAIL (send to everyone)',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'Subject (merge-field version — works for all profiles):',
  '{{contact.first_name}}, quick idea for {{contact.company_name}} in {{contact.city}}',
  '',
  'Body — UNIVERSAL template (profile adapts via merge fields):',
  'Hi {{contact.first_name}},',
  '',
  'I\'m with {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}. I was looking at local businesses in {{contact.city}} and noticed {{contact.company_name}} may have room to improve online.',
  '',
  '{{custom_field.AdHello Sender Pitch}}',
  '',
  'Here is a free quick scan — no signup required:',
  '{{custom_field.AdHello Audit Link}}',
  '(If audit link is blank, use your GHL widget: [GHL AUDIT LINK])',
  '',
  'If useful, reply and I can walk you through the top fix.',
  '',
  'Best,',
  '[Your name]',
  '{{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}',
  '',
  '--- EXAMPLE: FLOORING profile ---',
  'Subject: {{contact.first_name}} — floor refinish leads in {{contact.city}}?',
  'Body hook: We help {{contact.city}} flooring contractors turn website visitors into booked estimates. Most shops lose 30–40% of calls after hours.',
  'CTA: Free showroom-quality site scan: [GHL AUDIT LINK or AdHello Audit Link]',
  '',
  '--- EXAMPLE: REVIEWS APP profile ---',
  'Subject: {{contact.company_name}} — review velocity in {{contact.city}}',
  'Body hook: We built a simple app that automates review requests after each job — most {{contact.city}} contractors plateau under 50 Google reviews.',
  'CTA: 60-second demo of your review gap: [GHL AUDIT LINK or product demo URL in AdHello Audit Link]',
  '',
  '--- EXAMPLE: ADHELLO CONSULTING profile ---',
  'Subject: {{contact.company_name}} local visibility in {{contact.city}}',
  'Body hook: I run AdHello — we help local service businesses fix Google visibility, site speed, and follow-up so more map searches become calls.',
  'CTA: Free 60-second site scan: [GHL AUDIT LINK]',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'STEP 2 — WAIT 2 DAYS',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'STEP 3 — DAY 3 SMS (mobile numbers only)',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'Condition (IF branch):',
  '• Custom field "AdHello SMS OK" equals "Yes"',
  '  OR "AdHello Phone Line Type" is Mobile or VoIP',
  '• Skip this step for Landline (SMS OK = No)',
  '',
  'SMS — universal (merge fields):',
  'Hi {{contact.first_name}} — {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}} here. Sent {{contact.company_name}} a free scan for {{contact.city}}: {{custom_field.AdHello Audit Link}}. Reply YES for help.',
  '',
  'SMS — flooring variant:',
  'Hi {{contact.first_name}}, it\'s [name] from {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}. Quick floor-lead scan for {{contact.company_name}}: [link]. Reply YES if you want more estimate requests.',
  '',
  'SMS — reviews app variant:',
  'Hi {{contact.first_name}} — we help {{contact.city}} contractors get more Google reviews on autopilot. 60-sec check for {{contact.company_name}}: [link]. Reply DEMO for a walkthrough.',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'STEP 4 — DAY 5 VOICEMAIL / RVM (optional)',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'Universal script:',
  '"Hi, this is [Your name] with {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}. I emailed {{contact.company_name}} in {{contact.city}} about {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Pitch}}. Check your inbox for the link, or reply to this number."',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'REPLY & STOP RULES',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  '• If contact replies to email or SMS → remove from workflow, notify owner',
  '• Max 1 email + 1 SMS in first 7 days unless they engage',
  '• Do NOT mention AdHello audit reports — use AdHello Audit Link or your GHL audit widget only',
  '• Sign as the sender business in AdHello Sender Business, not a generic agency name, unless that IS the profile',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'GHL AI EMAIL WRITER PROMPTS — paste per vertical or use universal',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  '',
  'UNIVERSAL (works for any synced profile):',
  '"Write a short, friendly cold email under 100 words.',
  'You represent: {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}} ({{custom_field.AdHello Sender Vertical}}).',
  'Prospect: {{contact.company_name}} in {{contact.city}}. Website: {{contact.website}}.',
  'Core offer: {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Pitch}}.',
  'Goal: offer a free scan at {{custom_field.AdHello Audit Link}} (or [GHL AUDIT LINK] if blank).',
  'Tone: helpful local expert for THAT vertical — not pushy. Use business name and city naturally.',
  'No attachments. Sign off with [Your name] and {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}."',
  '',
  'FLOORING variant:',
  '"Write under 90 words to a local flooring contractor owner. You are {{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}. Mention {{contact.city}} and {{contact.company_name}}. Hook: more booked in-home estimates from their website. CTA: free site scan. Warm craftsman tone, not corporate."',
  '',
  'REVIEWS APP variant:',
  '"Write under 90 words to a {{contact.city}} service business owner. You sell a review-automation app ({{custom_field.AdHello Sender Business}}). Hook: competitors have 2x their Google reviews. CTA: quick review-gap demo link. Friendly SaaS founder tone."',
  '',
  'ADHELLO CONSULTING variant:',
  '"Write under 90 words as AdHello digital marketing. Prospect: {{contact.company_name}} in {{contact.city}}. Hook: local SEO / site conversion gaps costing calls. CTA: free 60-second website scan. Consultative, not agency-spam tone."',
  '',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  'GHL CHECKLIST PER PROFILE (do once per business you represent)',
  '═══════════════════════════════════════',
  '1. Create Offer in Agency OS (Scripts) with label, value prop, vertical, auditLink',
  '2. Assign that offer to the folder(s) or auto-pool that should use it',
  '3. In GHL: verify custom fields AdHello Sender * appear on a test contact after Sync GHL',
  '4. Set verified sending domain / SMS number appropriate to that business if you white-label',
  '5. Paste [GHL AUDIT LINK] or store URL in offer auditLink field in Agency OS',
  '6. Test enroll one lead → confirm email/SMS reads as the right business'
].join('\n'); %>
<div class="ghl-workflow-prompt-block rounded-2xl border border-brand-border/50 dark:border-white/10 bg-brand-cream/30 dark:bg-slate-950/50 p-4 md:p-5">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3">
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-yellow mb-1">Copy &amp; paste into GHL</p>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-dark dark:text-white text-sm md:text-base">Auto-outreach workflow setup prompt</h3>
      <% if (!_compact) { %>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mt-1">Paste into GHL workflow notes, an AI assistant, or send to whoever configures your sub-account. Supports <strong class="text-brand-dark dark:text-white">multiple business profiles</strong> via AdHello sender merge fields. Replace <code class="text-[10px] px-1 rounded bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-800">[GHL AUDIT LINK]</code> when a profile has no auditLink set.</p>
      <% } else { %>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mt-1">Configure the <code class="text-[10px] px-1 rounded bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-800">auto-outreach</code> tag workflow — includes multi-business sender merge fields.</p>
      <% } %>
    </div>
    <button type="button" id="<%= _copyBtnId %>" class="shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-brand-dark dark:bg-brand-yellow text-white dark:text-brand-dark px-4 py-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity" data-copy-target="<%= _promptId %>">Copy prompt</button>
  </div>
  <textarea id="<%= _promptId %>" readonly rows="<%= _compact ? 16 : 24 %>" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-brand-border/40 dark:border-white/10 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 px-3 py-3 text-[11px] md:text-xs font-mono leading-relaxed text-brand-dark dark:text-slate-100 resize-y min-h-[10rem] custom-scrollbar" aria-label="GHL auto-outreach workflow setup prompt"><%= _promptText %></textarea>
  <p id="<%= _copyStatusId %>" class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 hidden" role="status">Copied to clipboard.</p>
</div>
<script>
(function () {
  var btn = document.getElementById('<%= _copyBtnId %>');
  var ta = document.getElementById('<%= _promptId %>');
  var status = document.getElementById('<%= _copyStatusId %>');
  if (!btn || !ta) return;
  btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
    var text = ta.value || ta.textContent || '';
    function done(ok) {
      if (!status) return;
      status.textContent = ok ? 'Copied to clipboard.' : 'Copy failed — select the text and copy manually.';
      status.classList.toggle('text-emerald-700', ok);
      status.classList.toggle('dark:text-emerald-300', ok);
      status.classList.toggle('text-amber-700', !ok);
      status.classList.toggle('dark:text-amber-300', !ok);
      status.classList.remove('hidden');
      setTimeout(function () { status.classList.add('hidden'); }, 3500);
    }
    if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () { done(true); }).catch(function () { done(false); });
    } else {
      ta.focus();
      ta.select();
      try {
        done(document.execCommand('copy'));
      } catch (e) {
        done(false);
      }
    }
  });
})();
</script>
